text This is a strange sight...
text Flocks of students from my school are walking about.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Then again, this is what it's supposed to be like...)
sound RT.aac
text @[Student]
text Good morning.
sound RU.aac
text @[Student]
text Morning!
text Greetings pass through the air as I stand there, but...
text Not a single person says "hello" to me.
text They all just walk by with smiles on their faces.
text I'm probably invisible to all of them.
text Which would also mean that if I were to just turn around and wander off, no one would stop me.
if intF[2] == 1
	goto s8
