label s8
text @[Tomoya]
text (Maybe I'll just run off somewhere...)
sound RV.aac
text @[Voice]
text Where are you going?
text Someone tugs on my sleeve.
text So, someone can see me after all.
text Whoever it is, they must be like me. Another inhabitant of this invisible world.
