sound S6.aac
text @[Voice]
text Hey, Okazaki.
text A voice calls out to me right as the period ends, but I quickly realize it's just my teacher's. Like a good student, I decide to ignore it.
sound S7.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Can you not hear me, Okazaki?
text Ugh, he's so persistent.
text @[Tomoya]
text What is it?
text I raise my head while answering him, a tone of distrust and annoyance heard in my voice.
text My homeroom teacher walks right up to me.
sound S8.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Where's Sunohara?
text @[Tomoya]
text Sunohara?
text I look at the desk next to mine.
text He's right. Sunohara's not there.
text @[Tomoya]
text Who knows?
sound S9.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Could you find him and bring him to me?
text @[Tomoya]
text What? Me?
sound SA.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Yes, Okazaki. You.
text @[Tomoya]
text Why?
sound SB.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Because I think you'd have a good idea where he might be.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nope, nothing coming to mind.
sound SC.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I see...
sound SD.aac
text @[Teacher]
text In that case, you'll be coming with me in his place.
text @[Tomoya]
text Where to?
sound SE.aac
text @[Teacher]
text The teachers' room, of course.
text @[Tomoya]
text Why?
sound SF.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Do you know how many times you've been late to school, Okazaki?
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm not as bad as Sunohara, though. At least I show up before lunch.
sound SG.aac
text @[Teacher]
text That might matter to you, but teachers don't really make that kind of distinction.
sound SH.aac
text @[Teacher]
text In any case, if Sunohara's not here, you're next on the list.
text @[Tomoya]
text *Sigh*
text What a depressing situation this is.
text But if it means that I can skip class after this, it seems wisest to just do as he says and look for Sunohara.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay, I understand. I'll go find him.
text I turn around and start walking.
sound SI.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Hey, Okazaki! Not right now, after classes are over!
text I pretend to not hear that last bit.
text Now I've got plausible deniability, and can blame him if I get scolded for skipping out on the rest of the day.
